    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/a2c0da1f5694cfc43c4d5fe1d9b712eb.poster.avif?t=1753740003\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/a2c0da1f5694cfc43c4d5fe1d9b712eb.webm?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/a2c0da1f5694cfc43c4d5fe1d9b712eb.mp4?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollout Rally is a physics-powered marble racing party game where unpredictable chaos meets tactical fun. Whether you're racing with friends or spectating wild physics unfold, it's all about strategy, surprises, and unforgettable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Power:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before every race, choose from powerful cards that enhance your marble\u2019s abilities. Need a boost? Want more points with a twist? Each card changes the game literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/eae84e17eb6fc7149471d40c01cfa90c.poster.avif?t=1753740003\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/eae84e17eb6fc7149471d40c01cfa90c.webm?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/eae84e17eb6fc7149471d40c01cfa90c.mp4?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxed Yet Competitive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race solo or with up to 5 friends. Player input is minimal, but the thrill is maximum. Perfect for those who want exciting, low-pressure fun or just love to watch marbles roll.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Camera Control:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the action with a smooth auto-follow camera, or switch to free camera mode to view the chaos from any angle. Ideal for spectators, content creators, and streamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/adc3fd6126fe7c0a76e38d8261a86798.poster.avif?t=1753740003\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/adc3fd6126fe7c0a76e38d8261a86798.webm?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/adc3fd6126fe7c0a76e38d8261a86798.mp4?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Chaos Awaits:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple marble types with unique traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time: leaderboard + timer-based scoring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of obstacle-filled tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (PvP) for up to 6 players, plus Single Player (PvE) mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic card-drafting system to influence performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based gameplay with high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, fun to master \u2013 accessible for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing the fastest time, outsmarting your friends, or simply enjoying the chaos of marble racing, <i>Rollout Rally</i> offers a vibrant and strategic twist on competitive fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XP-based unlocks and player progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards &amp; seasonal events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom race modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Fun Nights In:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re gathering with friends, streaming for viewers, or relaxing solo Rollout Rally brings laughter, competition, and total mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to your wishlist today and be ready to roll!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/a2c0da1f5694cfc43c4d5fe1d9b712eb.poster.avif?t=1753740003\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/a2c0da1f5694cfc43c4d5fe1d9b712eb.webm?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/a2c0da1f5694cfc43c4d5fe1d9b712eb.mp4?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollout Rally is a physics-powered marble racing party game where unpredictable chaos meets tactical fun. Whether you're racing with friends or spectating wild physics unfold, it's all about strategy, surprises, and unforgettable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Power:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before every race, choose from powerful cards that enhance your marble\u2019s abilities. Need a boost? Want more points with a twist? Each card changes the game literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/eae84e17eb6fc7149471d40c01cfa90c.poster.avif?t=1753740003\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/eae84e17eb6fc7149471d40c01cfa90c.webm?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/eae84e17eb6fc7149471d40c01cfa90c.mp4?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxed Yet Competitive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race solo or with up to 5 friends. Player input is minimal, but the thrill is maximum. Perfect for those who want exciting, low-pressure fun or just love to watch marbles roll.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Camera Control:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the action with a smooth auto-follow camera, or switch to free camera mode to view the chaos from any angle. Ideal for spectators, content creators, and streamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/adc3fd6126fe7c0a76e38d8261a86798.poster.avif?t=1753740003\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/adc3fd6126fe7c0a76e38d8261a86798.webm?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830030/extras/adc3fd6126fe7c0a76e38d8261a86798.mp4?t=1753740003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Chaos Awaits:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple marble types with unique traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against time: leaderboard + timer-based scoring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of obstacle-filled tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (PvP) for up to 6 players, plus Single Player (PvE) mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic card-drafting system to influence performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based gameplay with high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, fun to master \u2013 accessible for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing the fastest time, outsmarting your friends, or simply enjoying the chaos of marble racing, <i>Rollout Rally</i> offers a vibrant and strategic twist on competitive fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XP-based unlocks and player progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards &amp; seasonal events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom race modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Fun Nights In:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re gathering with friends, streaming for viewers, or relaxing solo Rollout Rally brings laughter, competition, and total mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to your wishlist today and be ready to roll!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A vibrant, physics-based marble racing game where chaos meets strategy! Pick special cards, race through wild tracks, and control the view with dynamic cameras. Laugh, roll, and rally your way to the top. Wishlist Now!",
